 ## Background
-NARF was introduced in the paper "Neural Articulated Radiance Field" [S1]. It addresses the challenge of representing articulated 3D objects by combining neural radiance fields with kinematic models. The method was developed to overcome the limitations of Part-Wise and Holistic NARF approaches, offering a disentangled representation that is both efficient and accurate [S1].
